    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/837b3a4f85b588512371752230193782.avif?t=1750504884\" data-has-big width=800 height=212 /></span><strong>Foul is a survival game set in a post-apocalyptic environment.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It takes you into a world where every action matters and essential supplies are hard to come by. Explore the vast world filled with infected species that need to be dealt with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight off the infected with a range of different weapons.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in fierce combat with enemies found everywhere in the world. Use all kinds of melee and ranged weapons in your defence. Do you stand a chance against the infected?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/ead7bd571d75a0c9fca543c39bb3083d.poster.avif?t=1750504884\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/ead7bd571d75a0c9fca543c39bb3083d.webm?t=1750504884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/ead7bd571d75a0c9fca543c39bb3083d.mp4?t=1750504884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Drive like there is no tomorrow.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cars are rare but valuable, allowing for quick map traversal and offering the potential to inflict significant damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/bf30217da2164929bf4822065f28bfd1.poster.avif?t=1750504884\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/bf30217da2164929bf4822065f28bfd1.webm?t=1750504884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/bf30217da2164929bf4822065f28bfd1.mp4?t=1750504884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build and defend your base.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No place in this world is safe but it is always better to have some shelter. Place walls and other structures to ensure you don't get surprised by the infected.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/775402408e7b86b417aeb77ae04e66ff.poster.avif?t=1750504884\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/775402408e7b86b417aeb77ae04e66ff.webm?t=1750504884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/775402408e7b86b417aeb77ae04e66ff.mp4?t=1750504884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a lot of various locations.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is filled with many notable landmarks. Pick your way of travel either by foot or by a car and then embark on a journey in order to find all of the places left behind by humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/13aa81363774a5a09751eeba6ae76518.poster.avif?t=1750504884\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/13aa81363774a5a09751eeba6ae76518.webm?t=1750504884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/13aa81363774a5a09751eeba6ae76518.mp4?t=1750504884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect valuable resources.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The map is filled with all kinds of supplies which can be used as materials for crafting necessary equipment and structures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/129503c42785a86340c13f537b1d09a9.poster.avif?t=1750504884\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/129503c42785a86340c13f537b1d09a9.webm?t=1750504884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/129503c42785a86340c13f537b1d09a9.mp4?t=1750504884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Search for water, food and other useful supplies.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basic necessities aren't taken for granted in this world. The resources are insufficient and the search for them is constant. Could you survive with limited supplies?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/aaa2ba8588f7b655ef5a97fae4f26ee6.poster.avif?t=1750504884\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/aaa2ba8588f7b655ef5a97fae4f26ee6.webm?t=1750504884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/aaa2ba8588f7b655ef5a97fae4f26ee6.mp4?t=1750504884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/837b3a4f85b588512371752230193782.avif?t=1750504884\" data-has-big width=800 height=212 /></span><strong>Foul is a survival game set in a post-apocalyptic environment.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It takes you into a world where every action matters and essential supplies are hard to come by. Explore the vast world filled with infected species that need to be dealt with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight off the infected with a range of different weapons.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in fierce combat with enemies found everywhere in the world. Use all kinds of melee and ranged weapons in your defence. Do you stand a chance against the infected?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/ead7bd571d75a0c9fca543c39bb3083d.poster.avif?t=1750504884\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/ead7bd571d75a0c9fca543c39bb3083d.webm?t=1750504884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/ead7bd571d75a0c9fca543c39bb3083d.mp4?t=1750504884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Drive like there is no tomorrow.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cars are rare but valuable, allowing for quick map traversal and offering the potential to inflict significant damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/bf30217da2164929bf4822065f28bfd1.poster.avif?t=1750504884\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/bf30217da2164929bf4822065f28bfd1.webm?t=1750504884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/bf30217da2164929bf4822065f28bfd1.mp4?t=1750504884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build and defend your base.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No place in this world is safe but it is always better to have some shelter. Place walls and other structures to ensure you don't get surprised by the infected.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/775402408e7b86b417aeb77ae04e66ff.poster.avif?t=1750504884\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/775402408e7b86b417aeb77ae04e66ff.webm?t=1750504884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/775402408e7b86b417aeb77ae04e66ff.mp4?t=1750504884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a lot of various locations.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is filled with many notable landmarks. Pick your way of travel either by foot or by a car and then embark on a journey in order to find all of the places left behind by humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/13aa81363774a5a09751eeba6ae76518.poster.avif?t=1750504884\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/13aa81363774a5a09751eeba6ae76518.webm?t=1750504884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/13aa81363774a5a09751eeba6ae76518.mp4?t=1750504884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect valuable resources.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The map is filled with all kinds of supplies which can be used as materials for crafting necessary equipment and structures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/129503c42785a86340c13f537b1d09a9.poster.avif?t=1750504884\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/129503c42785a86340c13f537b1d09a9.webm?t=1750504884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/129503c42785a86340c13f537b1d09a9.mp4?t=1750504884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Search for water, food and other useful supplies.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basic necessities aren't taken for granted in this world. The resources are insufficient and the search for them is constant. Could you survive with limited supplies?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/aaa2ba8588f7b655ef5a97fae4f26ee6.poster.avif?t=1750504884\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/aaa2ba8588f7b655ef5a97fae4f26ee6.webm?t=1750504884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/aaa2ba8588f7b655ef5a97fae4f26ee6.mp4?t=1750504884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
